a2=A.b([new A.bM("c_right",b2,g7,""),new A.bM("c_front",b3,"F' U' F",""),new A.bM("c_up",a2,"R U2 R' U' R U R'","")],i1)
b2=$.i==="en"
b3=b2?"Trick 4: Use U instead of rotating the cube":"Trick 4: D\xf9ng U thay v\xec xoay c\u1ea3 cube"
b4=b2?"Rotate the whole cube less so you don't lose track of pieces.":"Gi\u1ea3m s\u1ed1 l\u1ea7n xoay c\u1ea3 cube \u0111\u1ec3 kh\xf4ng m\u1ea5t d\u1ea5u c\xe1c m\u1ea3nh."
b5=b2?"In step 3, turn U to bring the edge to the front; only rotate the whole cube when you must.":"\u1ede b\u01b0\u1edbc 3, xoay U \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1eb7t, ch\u1ec9 xoay c\u1ea3 cube khi b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c."
